          "starterCode": "import java.util.ArrayList;\n\npublic class SimCard {\n    private int simId;\n    private String phoneNumber;\n    private double balance;\n\n    public SimCard(int simId, String phoneNumber, double balance) {\n        // TODO: set fields\n    }\n\n    // TODO: getters & setters\n\n    @Override\n    public String toString() {\n        // TODO: \"simId,phoneNumber,balance(2dp)\"\n        return null;\n    }\n}\n\nclass SimCardList extends ArrayList<SimCard> {\n    public SimCard getSimByPhoneNumber(String phoneNumber) {\n        // TODO: linear search, null if not found\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    public int countSimByBalance(double amount) {\n        // TODO: count balance <= amount\n        return 0;\n    }\n}",
          "sampleSolution": "public class SimCard {\n    private int simId;\n    private String phoneNumber;\n    private double balance;\n\n    public SimCard(int simId, String phoneNumber, double balance) {\n        this.simId = simId;\n        this.phoneNumber = phoneNumber;\n        this.balance = balance;\n    }\n\n    public int getSimId() {\n        return simId;\n    }\n\n    public void setSimId(int simId) {\n        this.simId = simId;\n    }\n\n    public String getPhoneNumber() {\n        return phoneNumber;\n    }\n\n    public void setPhoneNumber(String phoneNumber) {\n        this.phoneNumber = phoneNumber;\n    }\n\n    public double getBalance() {\n        return balance;\n    }\n\n    public void setBalance(double balance) {\n        this.balance = balance;\n    }\n\n    @Override\n    public String toString() {\n        return simId + \",\" + phoneNumber + \",\" + String.format(\"%.2f\", balance);\n    }\n}\n\nimport java.util.ArrayList;\n\npublic class SimCardList extends ArrayList<SimCard> {\n\n    public SimCard getSimByPhoneNumber(String phoneNumber) {\n        for (SimCard s : this) {\n            if (s.getPhoneNumber().equals(phoneNumber)) {\n                return s;\n            }\n        }\n        return null;\n    }\n\n    public int countSimByBalance(double amount) {\n        int count = 0;\n        for (SimCard s : this) {\n            if (s.getBalance() <= amount) {\n                count++;\n            }\n        }\n        return count;\n    }\n}",
          "expectedOutput": "Sample run 1 (TC 1 — getSimByPhoneNumber; 5 sims pre-added with balances 100/300/200/500/400, 6th sim id=6 phone=0906123456 balance=800, search \"0906123456\"):\nOUTPUT:\n6,0906123456,800.00\n\nSample run 2 (TC 2 — countSimByBalance(480); same 5 pre-added sims, 6th sim id=6 phone=0906123456 balance=50):\nOUTPUT:\n5",
          "explanation": "<p>Verified by writing a driver matching the exact prompts and running both official sample TCs byte-for-byte (5 pre-added sims with balances 100/300/200/500/400, plus a 6th user-entered sim per TC). Trap: <code>countSimByBalance</code> compares with <strong>\"less than or equal to\"</strong> (&lt;=), not \"less than\" — confirmed both from the spec text and from TC2's count matching exactly with a &lt;= amount comparison.</p>\n<pre>TC1 (6th sim: id=6, phone=0906123456, balance=800) — getSimByPhoneNumber(\"0906123456\"): OUTPUT: 6,0906123456,800.00\nTC1 (searching a non-existent phone number): OUTPUT: N/A (student's own driver choice for a null result — the graded method itself must return null, per spec)\nTC2 (6th sim: id=6, phone=0906123456, balance=50) — countSimByBalance(480): OUTPUT: 5\n  (balances <= 480: 100, 300, 200, 400, 50 -> 5 sims; 500 is excluded)</pre>|||<p>Đã kiểm bằng cách viết driver khớp đúng các prompt và chạy đủ 2 TC chính thức khớp từng ký tự (5 sim thêm sẵn balance 100/300/200/500/400, cộng sim thứ 6 do người dùng nhập mỗi TC). Bẫy: <code>countSimByBalance</code> so sánh <strong>\"nhỏ hơn hoặc bằng\"</strong> (&lt;=), không phải \"nhỏ hơn\" — xác nhận cả từ đặc tả chữ lẫn từ kết quả đếm TC2 khớp đúng khi so sánh &lt;=.</p>\n<pre>TC1 (sim thứ 6: id=6, phone=0906123456, balance=800) — getSimByPhoneNumber(\"0906123456\"): OUTPUT: 6,0906123456,800.00\nTC1 (tìm số điện thoại không tồn tại): OUTPUT: N/A (cách driver mẫu của học viên tự chọn để hiển thị null — hàm được chấm chỉ cần trả về null theo đúng đặc tả)\nTC2 (sim thứ 6: id=6, phone=0906123456, balance=50) — countSimByBalance(480): OUTPUT: 5\n  (balance <= 480: 100, 300, 200, 400, 50 -> 5 sim; loại 500)</pre>",
